@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
title Noleggio — addebito integrale e Observer nella transazione
autonumber
actor Cliente
boundary ClientDashboardView as ui
control RentalService as service
participant DatabaseManager as db
participant VehicleDao as vehicle
participant UserDao as user
participant RentDao as rent
participant BankAccountDao as account
participant VehicleEventPublisher as publisher
participant TestDriveCancellationObserver as observer
participant TestDriveDao as td
Cliente -> ui : selezione RENT; dialogo date, OK
note over Cliente,ui : Annulla: nessuna prenotazione. Preventivo non congela il prezzo.
ui -> service : bookRental(vehicleId, clientId, start, end)
service -> db : executeInTransactionWithResult(callback)
service -> vehicle : findByIdForUpdate(vehicleId, conn)
note over service,vehicle : Stato RENT; date valide; lock veicolo prima del cliente.
service -> user : lockClient(clientId, conn)
service -> rent : isVehicleAvailableForRent(vehicleId, start, end, conn)
note over service,rent
  Giorni inclusivi, controllo sovrapposizioni; vincolo EXCLUDE nel DB.
  Ricalcola costo con modello/sconti letti sulla stessa connessione.
end note
service -> account : findByClientIdForUpdate(clientId, conn)
service -> account : updateBalance(..., saldo - costo100%, conn)
service -> rent : save(Rent, conn)
service -> publisher : publishCommitment(event, conn)
publisher -> observer : onVehicleCommitted(event, conn)
observer -> td : deleteFutureByVehicleId(vehicleId, conn)
note over observer,td : Tutti i test drive futuri, anche fuori periodo; passato conservato.
db -> db : commit / close
service --> ui : Rent
ui --> Cliente : aggiorna saldo/operazioni e mostra successo
note over service,db
  Eccezione, saldo insufficiente o Observer fallito:
  tenta rollback, close, errore UI; nessun successo parziale.
  Il veicolo resta RENT; non esiste una riga Payment.
end note
@enduml
